      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "\"Pro Ana\": Psychodynamic References for Anorexia Nervosa The internet-based phenomenon \"Pro Ana\" refers to the eating disorder anorexia nervosa in a positive way. To understand what the phenomenon \"Pro Ana\" represents, the websites are used as a starting point of the current analysis. Based on these results, similarities and differences between \"Pro Ana\" and the eating disorder anorexia nervosa are discussed. Furthermore psychodynamic references for anorexia nervosa are derived and finally their importance for treatment motivation will be considered."},
